flowchart TB
  J5[JUnit 5 Architecture]
  J5 --> PLATFORM[JUnit Platform]
  PLATFORM --> LAUNCHER[Launcher API]
  PLATFORM --> ENGINE[Test Engine SPI]
  PLATFORM --> IDE[IDE / Build Tool Integration]

  J5 --> JUPITER[JUnit Jupiter]
  JUPITER --> ANN[Annotations]
  ANN --> TEST[Test]
  ANN --> PARA[ParameterizedTest]
  ANN --> REPT[RepeatedTest]
  ANN --> TESTF[TestFactory]
  JUPITER --> ASSERT[Assertions]
  ASSERT --> STD[Standard Assertions]
  ASSERT --> SOFT[SoftAssertions]
  ASSERT --> TIMED[assertTimeout]
  ASSERT --> THROW[assertThrows]
  JUPITER --> ASSUME[Assumptions]
  JUPITER --> NEST[Nested Tests]
  JUPITER --> TAG[Tagging / Filtering]
  JUPITER --> DISP[DisplayName]
  JUPITER --> LIFE[Lifecycle]
  LIFE --> BEFALL[BeforeAll]
  LIFE --> BFE[BeforeEach]
  LIFE --> AFE[AfterEach]
  LIFE --> AFALL[AfterAll]

  JUPITER --> PARAM[Parameterized Tests]
  PARAM --> VALUE[ValueSource]
  PARAM --> CSV[CsvSource]
  PARAM --> ENUM[EnumSource]
  PARAM --> METHOD[MethodSource]
  PARAM --> ARGS[Arguments Accessor]

  JUPITER --> DYN[Dynamic Tests]
  DYN --> DYNT[DynamicTest]
  DYN --> DYNC[DynamicContainer]

  J5 --> EXT[Extension Model]
  EXT --> EAPI[Extension API]
  EXT --> PAREX[ParameterResolver]
  EXT --> BEFEX[BeforeEachCallback]
  EXT --> AFEX[AfterEachCallback]
  EXT --> BEFALLEX[BeforeAllCallback]
  EXT --> EXHAND[ExecutionCondition]

  J5 --> VINTAGE[JUnit Vintage]
  VINTAGE --> J4[JUnit 4 Runner]
  VINTAGE --> MIG[Migration Support]
